# 【依嚴重度分流】critical 寄給值班信箱,warning 寄給維運群組信箱
$ route.routes: severity="critical" → oncall-critical
▶ 同時送 critical 與 warning 兩個告警:依嚴重度分流,critical 寄給值班信箱,warning 寄給維運群組信箱
critical:[HTTP 200];warning:[HTTP 200]
   15 秒後:兩封信都到
收件匣:
  [Kafka][FIRING] RouteWarn(warning) | kafka-ops@corp.demo | 1 alert for alertname=RouteWarn severity=warning View in Alertmanager [1] Firing
  [Kafka][CRITICAL][FIRING] RouteCrit | kafka-oncall@corp.demo | 1 alert for alertname=RouteCrit severity=critical View in Alertmanager [1] Firin
判定:依嚴重度分流:critical 只寄給值班信箱 kafka-oncall@corp.demo,warning 寄給維運群組信箱 kafka-ops@corp.demo
